# MVP (Current Focus)

These features are required before the first usable release.

## Core Experience

- Homepage dashboard
- Best protein-per-dollar meals OPTIONAL
- Best calories-per-dollar meals OPTIONAL
- Meals under a configurable price
- Active restaurant deals
- Restaurant detail page
- Menu item detail page
- Filtering
    - Maximum price
    - Minimum protein
    - Calories
    - Distance
- Sorting
    - Lowest price
    - Protein per dollar
    - Calories per dollar
So your value proposition becomes:

Cheapest meals under $10
Biggest portions (if you can crowdsource later)
Student discounts
BOGO deals
Happy hour specials
Free food events

## Backend

- Restaurant models
- Menu item models
- Deal models
- Homepage endpoint
- Restaurant endpoints
